data: {"id": "fefbc55183ff41a4-thinking-parallel_evidence-2284", "run_id": "fefbc55183ff41a4", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "我已阅读所有前置工具结果。Pod 当前处于 **CrashLoopBackOff**，`exitCode=2`，上一次崩溃前日志为 `{\"event\":\"http_request\",\"level\":\"error\",\"message\":\"runtime process exiting\",\"http_status\":500}`。\n\n为找出 `exitCode=2` 的根因，我将继续采集以下证据：\n1. **current logs**：容器最近一次启动是否输出了新的错误日志（如 Python 异常栈）。\n2. **Describe (Conditions)**：确认 `ContainersNotReady` 的具体原因。\n3. **Topology**：确认容器归属及网络情况，排除侧车/网络问题。\n\n开始采集：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789071686160, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

